  "policyClassTolerance": "Every scored Case rests on project policy (maintainer-only, basis project-policy): the policy does not fix one defensible extent, attribution, type or action for a flagged value, so a tolerance class (for example a wider or narrower span that still covers the value, or a different family attribution) is part of what the Case allows. Not expressible. The unchanged scorer reports exact, over, under and partial as separate outcomes and `pass` requires exact; this corpus reports exact, fullyCovered and misses, and a non-exact outcome on a positive is a measurement to be read against the Case, not a verdict of the Case.",
